#: Settings.ui.h:33
msgid ""
"Hide the dock when it obstructs a window of the current application. More "
"refined settings are available."
msgstr ""
"Slēpt doku, kad tas aizsedz pašreizējās lietotnes logu. Ir pieejami "
"rafinētāki iestatījumi."

