#: Settings.ui.h:66
msgid ""
"Enable Super+(0-9) as shortcuts to activate apps. It can also be used "
"together with Shift and Ctrl."
msgstr ""
"Ieslēgt Super+(0-9) kā saīsnes, lai aktivizētu lietotnes. To var izmantot "
"kopā ar Shift un Ctrl."

